		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050060"},
		line=723,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, you got a minute?”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Akari calls out from outside my door as I polish my blade.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“C'mon in.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've recovered enough to walk on your own, haven't you?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, less 'walk' and more 'hobble around with a crutch.'”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How 'bout we go on a little stroll?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Careful. There's a step right here.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"With Akari to lean on, the two of us slowly make our way to the main road leading into Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're walking better than I expected!”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hard to call it 'walking' if I still have to lean on someone else.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I sit down on a nearby bench and cast my gaze down the road.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Priests and priestesses pass by, one after another.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“About earlier...”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What made you think I was the Founding Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know how to explain it either. I can only describe it like an instinct.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I was sleeping in the next room over when suddenly, I heard an earth-splitting sound akin to a lightning strike.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"I leapt to my feet and burst into Akari's room without a second thought.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Until the very instant I opened the screen door, all that was on my mind was Akari's safety.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"But the word that escaped my mouth when I saw her was the name “Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"The aura surrounding Akari in that ephemeral moment rendered me incapable of saying anything else.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Instinct, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Akari breathes a small sigh.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I bet the dream you saw was probably real.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You and the Founding Empress are bound together by an inseverable bond.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I bet that's why, even without your memories, you can tell that she's inside me.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Even after she finishes speaking, Akari does not lift her gaze from the ground.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Like the trees around us slowly shedding the last of their autumn leaves, her unmoving figure casts a forlorn shadow.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if that's the case, anything that happened with Himi-no-Mikoto is a thing of the past. You're the only one in front of me right now.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then if the Founding Empress appeared in front of you, which one of us would you obey?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“From that spring day forth, my life has been yours.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if I once was Mitsurugi, even if Himi-no-Mikoto appears before me now, so long as I continue to draw breath, my vow to you shall not perish.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I chose Akari as my lord, by my own will.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry. I never should've asked you that.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Gosh, what's wrong with me? It feels like I'm going a little crazy.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Same here.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Imagine being told out of nowhere that you've actually been alive for two thousand years.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hehee, hard to believe, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Akari smiles at me with a shrug.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All right. Let's promise each other.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No matter who we might turn out to be, we'll do everything we can to restore the Empire together.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even if we can't help but hesitate a bit, so long as we have a clear goal, we won't ever lose sight of what truly matters, right?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I like that.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The two of us will live for the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That way, no matter what the fates have in store for us,\nwe'll have no regrets.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Akari nods, her smile as radiant as the spring sun.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-sama, our preparations are complete, so please attend the bath at your leisure.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Are we really doing this?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Kotone is most keen on it, and it would be a terrible shame to disappoint her.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Leaving it there, Isuzu silently withdraws.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I suppose I've got to go.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh. So you're going.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Akari has been in a sour mood ever since this morning.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Last night during dinner─",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Kotone and Akari are chatting away as usual.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“At any rate, it is most fortuitous that Soujin-sama is able now to walk on his own!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Seriously. It was only a few days ago that he was basically a life-sized dress-up doll.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just being able to walk is nothing to be proud of. A warrior who can't even hold a blade has no purpose in life.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone's already doing everything she can for us.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All we can do is wait, right?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As a matter of fact, I have a certain additional remedy in mind.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Kotone declares with a strangely troubled expression.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it going to be difficult for you?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“U-Umm... I would not call it ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"difficult",
{"/font"},
" per se... however...”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-In any case! I shall make preparations to have it ready by tomorrow!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"At the time, I had no idea what this “remedy” Kotone had in mind was.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I can't believe she'd seriously suggest this with a straight face... That girl's got a few screws loose...”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Meanwhile, my lord has been grumbling my ear off all day.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you don't want me to do it, I'll call it off.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Absolutely not. You have to go.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's all so you can get your strength back, so calling it off was never an option.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, stop looking at me like a cat who just got her tail stepped on.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What, too good to have a cat as your lord?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Her Imperial Felineness and I, her loyal hound.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"An unconventional pairing, but I could see it.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-Thank you for joining us, Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“We shall now commence the ritual.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please do.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"A large congregation of priestesses await me in the water.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Naturally, Kotone is front and center among them.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“H-Hold it right there, Kotone! Wh-What the heck do you think you're wearing?!”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“R-Regardless of what your thoughts are, this is the standard attire when we partake in our ablutions...”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Indeed, all the priestesses are wearing loosely fitting bathrobes.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The thin cloth of their wet robes clings tightly to their skin, turning nearly see-through.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I do believe it is at least less objectionable than complete nudity, would you not agree?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Does it even matter?! You can practically see everything already!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Akari covers her face with her hands.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“N-Now then, let us begin!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"At Kotone's command, the priestesses surrounding me all close their eyes in prayer.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"In the next moment, the springwater begins to glow with a divine light.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"The phosphorescent water slowly swirls around my body as if drawn there by a will of its own.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wow...”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How is it, Soujin? Think it's working?”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know if it's helping me recover, but it's certainly warm and comfortable.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That just sounds like a regular bath.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"She has a point.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Do not lose focus, Your Eminence. You must bring your bodies into closer communion.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh, I know... But this is...”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Kotone and Isuzu each latch on to one of my arms.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"An ordinary man might lose their composure, but I've been told that this is also for the purpose of my recovery.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"It's only polite to keep my cool in a situation like this.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“S-Say, do you really need to do all this for Soujin to recover?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“B-But of course! I could never bring myself to do this were it not absolutely necessary!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“By embracing him thus, we are able to channel the medicinal properties of the bathwater directly into Tokita-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“This is a traditional means of healing passed down through the generations in Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It is even said that this therapy was the origin of the folk belief that hot springs are a cure for all ills.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd never heard of that.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Isuzu is a regular fount of knowledge. Ever since our youth, she has been at the top of the class at scholastics, magicks, anything you could think of.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You two go way back, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Isuzu and I were fellow pupils at the Imperial Seminary, and we spent much time training together as priestesses.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Not once did I ever place ahead of her.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And yet, for some inexplicable reason, I was the one chosen to become Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I was hoping that this promotion might have helped her gain a little confidence, but she's still the same as ever.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Isuzu watches over Kotone with a wry smile.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Seeing them next to each other like this, Isuzu certainly does seem like the more composed and dignified of the two.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The only virtue I have is my name.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“The succession of Exalt-Priestesses has only ever comprised those born to the most eminent priestly lineages.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“There are four such Houses: Shiinoha, Kusunoha, Hounoha, and Tochinoha. Each of their ancestries predates even the founding of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“On top of that, the first Exalt-Priestess was of House Shiinoha, which distinguishes their House even from the rest.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Shiinoha Chihaya...",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"If the contents of my dream are true, the station of Exalt-Priestess was established to administer the priesthood and to maintain Mitsurugi's body.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's work was never done, and so, she entrusted these duties to her Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, being born to a venerable House is no guarantee that your own magicks will be anything exceptional...”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How am I to ever face my ancestors? Oohh...”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"As Kotone hangs her head in shame, her ample chest naturally presses against me.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, don't stimulate me so much.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I'm sorry! How terribly indecent of me!”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Oh, why not simply own up to it and indulge yourself a little, Tokita-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Finding myself encircled from all sides, I look towards Akari for relief.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, aren't you living the high life, Soujin? Having yourself a pretty girl on each arm...”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is part of my treatment.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"So they say...",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, take your freaking time!”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I swear, that leering grin's gonna get stuck on your face...”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Blushing to the tips of her ears, Akari loudly stomps off on her own.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Does it really look like I'm leering?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You seem no different than usual to me.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooohh... I fear for what is to come for me, having offended Akari-sama so...”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Judging by the way Akari looked, she's going to be in a foul mood for quite some time.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You have my sympathies, Tokita-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You don't know the half of it.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
